        "Grosh'gok kept beasts for war and for the pot, and the Chained Maulers were the worst of them even before the light came. Now they've fused with their own chains, and they'd tear the walls down if they could get loose. They're staked in the ravine and round the yard. Kill them where they stand. When I go for my father, I don't want anything at my back.",
